OL,3,GNEWSARelief as Edinburgh's Princes
OL,4,AStreet reopens seven weeks after fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FEdinburgh's main thoroughfare, Princes
OL,7,FStreet, has fully reopened, seven weeks
OL,8,Fafter it was shut by a major fire in a
OL,9,Fformer department store.
OL,11,FBusinesses in the east of the city say
OL,12,Fthey have taken a hit during the
OL,13,Fusually-lucrative festival season, as
OL,14,Fdisruption to public transport has hit
OL,15,Ffootfall.
OL,17,FBus routes have been diverted and tram
OL,18,Fservices have only been operating in
OL,19,Fthe west of the city while work to make
OL,20,Fthe building safe took place.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
