OL,3,GNEWSARelief as Edinburgh's Princes
OL,4,AStreet reopens seven weeks after fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FEdinburgh council leader Jane Meagher
OL,7,Fsaid she was delighted the famous
OL,8,Fstreet was at last reopening but
OL,9,Facknowledged it had been a difficult
OL,10,Fchapter for the city.
